DESCRIPTION:Grade 12 PE / Health Period 3\n\n地点安排带有条件，
 请按原公告核对，不能视为无条件更换教室。\nPAP日志Exc
 el官方开始周。使用SAMPLE 2标签记录。确保遵循要求以获
 得每周“完成”评价，否则将记为“未完成”并在学期
 末补做。文档为OneDrive实时文件，请勿保存，直接在线编
 辑。\n\n公告原文：\nOct 19th Week. This then gives you 2 weeks of o
 pportunity to use the excel and to make sure you are following my expectat
 ions what is needed to earn a COMPLETE each week. Otherwise they become IN
 COMPLETE and you will be making it up in a MAKE UP DAY near the end of the
  semester. So make sure to work on these over the next two week. Thx Mr. D
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T114622Z
